[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psf/requests/issues/comments/96370131","html_url":"https://github.com/psf/requests/issues/2573#issuecomment-96370131","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psf/requests/issues/2573","id":96370131,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDk2MzcwMTMx","user":{"login":"Lukasa","id":1382556,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODI1NTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1382556?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa","html_url":"https://github.com/Lukasa","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2015-04-26T12:04:05Z","updated_at":"2015-04-26T12:04:05Z","body":"@Nelluk Can you provide more information on what causes this? Which server are you accessing, etc?\n\nAt the moment, the most likely change in that delta is the fact that we slightly changed our default SSL cipher list:\n\n```\n- ECDH+AESGCM:DH+AESGCM:ECDH+AES256:DH+AES256:ECDH+AES128:DH+AES:ECDH+3DES:DH+3DES:RSA+AESGCM:RSA+AES:RSA+3DES:!aNULL:!MD5:!DSS\n+ ECDH+AESGCM:DH+AESGCM:ECDH+AES256:DH+AES256:ECDH+AES128:DH+AES:ECDH+HIGH:DH+HIGH:ECDH+3DES:DH+3DES:RSA+AESGCM:RSA+AES:RSA+HIGH:RSA+3DES:!aNULL:!eNULL:!MD5\n```\n\nIt's possible this is causing a problem, though it's tricky to see how: knowing what server you're contacting would help me diagnose in that regard.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psf/requests/issues/comments/96370131/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psf/requests/issues/comments/96372205","html_url":"https://github.com/psf/requests/issues/2573#issuecomment-96372205","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psf/requests/issues/2573","id":96372205,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDk2MzcyMjA1","user":{"login":"Lukasa","id":1382556,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODI1NTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1382556?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa","html_url":"https://github.com/Lukasa","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2015-04-26T12:20:09Z","updated_at":"2015-04-26T12:20:09Z","body":"Some experimentation in IRC shows this to be transient: sometimes it works, sometimes it doesn't, but it only ever fails to work in 2.6.2: it always works in 2.6.0.\n\nThis suggests one of the two servers at this host has a bad cipher configuration that we don't like. Looking at the successful handshake, from 2.6.0 we negotiate TLS_RSA_WITH_RC4_128_SHA (a truly terrible cipher), whereas from 2.6.2 we negotiate TLS_RSA_WITH_3DES_EDE_CBC_SHA (still not great, but a bit better).\n\nLooks like the change to make is to pass a custom cipher set.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psf/requests/issues/comments/96372205/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psf/requests/issues/comments/96378399","html_url":"https://github.com/psf/requests/issues/2573#issuecomment-96378399","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psf/requests/issues/2573","id":96378399,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDk2Mzc4Mzk5","user":{"login":"Lukasa","id":1382556,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODI1NTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1382556?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa","html_url":"https://github.com/Lukasa","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2015-04-26T13:28:07Z","updated_at":"2015-04-26T13:28:07Z","body":"That said, it looks like RC4 should have been forbidden in the old codebase: I assume I'm missing a change where we now always override the stdlib cipher suite.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psf/requests/issues/comments/96378399/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psf/requests/issues/comments/96380353","html_url":"https://github.com/psf/requests/issues/2573#issuecomment-96380353","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psf/requests/issues/2573","id":96380353,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDk2MzgwMzUz","user":{"login":"sigmavirus24","id":240830,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MDgzMA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/240830?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sigmavirus24","html_url":"https://github.com/sigmavirus24","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sigmavirus24/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sigmavirus24/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sigmavirus24/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sigmavirus24/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sigmavirus24/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sigmavirus24/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sigmavirus24/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sigmavirus24/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sigmavirus24/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2015-04-26T13:48:21Z","updated_at":"2015-04-26T13:48:21Z","body":"Before we conditionally used our own cipher suite. Now we unconditionally use it.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psf/requests/issues/comments/96380353/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psf/requests/issues/comments/96387279","html_url":"https://github.com/psf/requests/issues/2573#issuecomment-96387279","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psf/requests/issues/2573","id":96387279,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDk2Mzg3Mjc5","user":{"login":"Lukasa","id":1382556,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODI1NTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1382556?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa","html_url":"https://github.com/Lukasa","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2015-04-26T14:09:54Z","updated_at":"2015-04-26T14:09:54Z","body":"Right, that'll do it. So, we probably broke some stuff there: we should at the very least blog about how to change the cipher suite.\n\nCory\n\n> On 26 Apr 2015, at 14:48, Ian Cordasco notifications@github.com wrote:\n> \n> Before we conditionally used our own cipher suite. Now we unconditionally use it.\n> \n> —\n> Reply to this email directly or view it on GitHub.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psf/requests/issues/comments/96387279/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psf/requests/issues/comments/101738684","html_url":"https://github.com/psf/requests/issues/2573#issuecomment-101738684","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psf/requests/issues/2573","id":101738684,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDEwMTczODY4NA==","user":{"login":"ju2wheels","id":396211,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NjIxMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/396211?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ju2wheels","html_url":"https://github.com/ju2wheels","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ju2wheels/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ju2wheels/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ju2wheels/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ju2wheels/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ju2wheels/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ju2wheels/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ju2wheels/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ju2wheels/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ju2wheels/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2015-05-13T16:32:14Z","updated_at":"2015-05-13T16:46:56Z","body":"Any follow up on that blog? Im hitting this issue in Python 2.7.9. How do we go about putting in a custom cipher suite?\n\n[Edit] Im using requests 2.7.0 and downgrading to 2.6.0 also works for me.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psf/requests/issues/comments/101738684/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psf/requests/issues/comments/101834638","html_url":"https://github.com/psf/requests/issues/2573#issuecomment-101834638","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psf/requests/issues/2573","id":101834638,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDEwMTgzNDYzOA==","user":{"login":"Lukasa","id":1382556,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODI1NTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1382556?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa","html_url":"https://github.com/Lukasa","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lukasa/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2015-05-13T22:15:49Z","updated_at":"2015-05-13T22:15:49Z","body":"For the moment, setting a custom cipher suite is done by changing `requests.packages.urllib3.util.ssl_.DEFAULT_CIPHERS` (or `requests.packages.urllib3.contrib.pyopenssl.DEFAULT_CIPHER_LIST` if you're using PyOpenSSL: best to change both).\n\nI'm holding off on a more formal bit of documentation for now because ideally we'll land a 'custom SSL context' patch into urllib3 that will make this API way better.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psf/requests/issues/comments/101834638/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psf/requests/issues/comments/113825129","html_url":"https://github.com/psf/requests/issues/2573#issuecomment-113825129","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psf/requests/issues/2573","id":113825129,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDExMzgyNTEyOQ==","user":{"login":"yogurt-island-331","id":5249746,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDk3NDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5249746?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/y